  "steps": [
    "Add the chickpeas, tahini, lemon juice, garlic, cumin and salt to a food processor or blender.",
    "Blend, scraping down the sides as needed, until the mixture starts to look smooth and thick.",
    "With the motor running, add the water a little at a time until the hummus is creamy and spoonable.",
    "Taste and adjust with a little more salt or lemon juice if needed.",
    "Spread the hummus into a bowl, make a shallow swirl on top, then drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle over the paprika."
